{pad:meta title='Frequently asked questions', about='A FAQ where opening a question closes the one that was open - the first one open at the start.'/}
<div style="width:100%; max-width:640px">
  <h2>Questions about your order</h2>
  {widget:accordion single, open=1}
    {widget:tab 'When will my order arrive?'}
      <p>Orders placed before 22:00 on a working day are delivered the next day in the
      Netherlands and Belgium, within three working days elsewhere in the EU.</p>
    {/widget:tab}
    {widget:tab 'Can I return something?'}
      <p>Yes - within 30 days, unused and in its box. Print the label from your account and
      drop the parcel at any pick-up point; the refund follows within five days.</p>
    {/widget:tab}
    {widget:tab 'Is there a warranty?'}
      <p>Two years on every appliance, five years on the heating element of our kettles.</p>
    {/widget:tab}
    {widget:tab 'How do I pay?'}
      <p>iDEAL, Bancontact, credit card, PayPal, or on account for business customers.</p>
    {/widget:tab}
  {/widget:accordion}
</div>
